em","/imagens/notacao/4x4/27.svg","meiaVolta",false,"basico","y","Turn the whole cube like a U (the right face comes to the front).","/imagens/notacao/4x4/26.svg","x","Turn the whole cube like an R (the front goes up).","/imagens/notacao/4x4/25.svg","M'","The 2 middle layers together, in the direction of R (the front goes up).","/imagens/notacao/4x4/24.svg","M","On the 4x4, M = the 2 middle layers together (2L + 3L), in the direction of L (the front goes down).","/imagens/notacao/4x4/23.svg","Bw","The 2 back layers together (B + 2B): a quarter turn like B.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/22.svg","2F","Only the 2nd layer from the front: a quarter turn like F.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/21.svg","Fw'","The 2 front layers together: a quarter turn like F'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/20.svg","Fw","The 2 front layers together (F + 2F): a quarter turn like F.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/19.svg","Dw","The 2 bottom layers together (D + 2D): a quarter turn like D.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/18.svg","2U'","Only the 2nd layer from the top: a quarter turn like U'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/17.svg","2U","Only the 2nd layer from the top: a quarter turn like U.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/16.svg","Uw2","The 2 top layers together: a half turn.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/15.svg",true,"Uw'","The 2 top layers together: a quarter turn like U'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/14.svg","Uw","The 2 top layers together (U + 2U): a quarter turn like U.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/13.svg","2L'","Only the 2nd layer from the left: a quarter turn like L'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/12.svg","2L","Only the 2nd layer from the left: a quarter turn like L.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/11.svg","Lw'","The 2 left layers together: a quarter turn like L'.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/10.svg","Lw","The 2 left layers together (L + 2L): a quarter turn like L.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/9.svg","3Rw","The 3 right layers together (everything but L): a quarter turn like R.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/8.svg","2R2","Only the 2nd layer from the right: a half turn.","/imagens/notacao/4x4/7.svg